{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hinana.interview",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "杂志拍摄之后的采访",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hinana.interview",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hinana.interview",
    "idolId": "hinana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "呀哈～♡谢谢您～！",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（采访开始了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "──雛菜以前就一直在看这本杂志，所以超开心的～！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（采访的人问了『今后的展望』。）",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "…………今后的展望，吗～……",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（对方笑着说『很难吧』。）",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊～不是那样……",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "学校最近也问了进路的事，雛菜才一年级呢～这么想着",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（对方说『不用想得太难，想做什么都可以』。）",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "雛菜想开开心心、幸幸福福地当偶像呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "说是偶像，又不只是那样……开开心心、幸幸福福的，就是雛菜。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "所以能让雛菜保持这样的，说不定就是偶像呢～？　我是这么想的。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "现在，我是这么想的。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（对方安静了一下，然后说『这个……很好呢』。）",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "…………诶……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（又说：粉丝也一定想看到市川小姐幸福的样子。）",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "…………啊哈～，是这样呢～？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "雛菜也这么想！所以为了那个，想试试各种各样的事～",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "只要是能变得开心、变得幸福的事，……什么都。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（采访结束了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊哈～，好开心，一转眼就结束了～……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "──啊，对了！最后，我想到了绝对要做的事！",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（对方问『是什么』。）",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "绝对绝对，还想上这本杂志！还要叫我哦～？",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──雛菜，辛苦了。拍摄和采访都很好哦！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊哈～，真的～？",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "可是雛菜，只是说了想到的事哦～？",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是吗？那就是说，那非常好吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "制作人，前阵子找到进路调查那张纸了吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？啊，嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "那时候我就想，按雛菜自己的想法来就好了呢～",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "不过，那也是当然的呢。因为这是雛菜的事嘛。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "就算被骂、被说不行，想做的事还是想做的～",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "想开开心心、幸幸福福的嘛？雛菜也是，大家一定也是。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "──所以雛菜，果然很适合当偶像吧！",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……是啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "以后，就多挑战各种事情，把雛菜的可能性拓宽吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "作为偶像，也作为一个人。",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……我也会一起挑战的。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～……只要不太辛苦的话哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "而且，是能开开心心、幸幸福福地做到的事～？",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………哈哈，是啊……！",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，雛菜就是这样，哈哈……！",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "因为很期待。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "因为很有趣。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "因为很高兴。",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嘿～……期待～？",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "雛菜以后会变成什么样呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "这样啊～～～那就要在旁边好好看着呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯！"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "诶～……雛菜被笑了～？",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是……哈哈……！抱歉雛菜，不是那样。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "骗人～！明明就在笑～！"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊哈～，这样啊～？嗯～，那样就好～",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，对吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～！开心的时候就会笑出来呢～"
      }
    }
  },
